(BUF-09: reading into a full fixed buffer stops, sets an error flag, discards data beyond capacity, and the program continues normally - catchable with On error.)
(expected output:
read overflow errored
8
1
This is 
program continued
)
open a file for reading called f at "docs/ledger/probes/buffers/fixtures/long.txt".
a buffer called small is 8 bytes in size.
Read from f into small.
On error print "read overflow errored".
print small's size.
print small's full.
print small.
Close f.
print "program continued".
